cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'quantmathlab: A research library for quantitative finance'
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Arias Gomez
    given-names: Alejandro
    email: aleexariasg@gmail.com
repository-code: 'https://github.com/aleexarias/quantmathlab'
abstract: |
  quantmathlab is a research library for quantitative finance, built paper
  by paper. Each paper's mathematics is developed in LaTeX notes, and the
  methods it needs are implemented as typed, tested code behind a small and
  consistent API, so that methods from different papers can be composed and
  compared on the same data.
keywords:
  - quantitative-finance
  - derivatives-pricing
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.1.2
